OL,3,ADebris in engine very likely caused
OL,4,ASpitfire crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDebris which had been present in the
OL,7,Fcarburettor of a Spitfire for decades
OL,8,Fwas "very likely" the cause of a crash
OL,9,Fin which a pilot died, according to a
OL,10,Freport.
OL,12,FSqn Ldr Mark Long was killed when the
OL,13,FBattle of Britain Memorial Flight
OL,14,F(BBMF) plane he was flying crashed in a
OL,15,Ffield in Lincolnshire on 25 May 2024.
OL,17,FA report published by the Ministry of
OL,18,FDefence says the debris was responsible
OL,19,Ffor causing fuel starvation, "leading
OL,20,Fto a loss of thrust required to
OL,21,Fmaintain powered flight".
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
